@startuml 27_timing_heartbeat
robust "Host connection state" as H
@0
H is PENDING
@10
H is CONNECTED : first accepted report
@20
H is CONNECTED : report
@30
H is CONNECTED : report
@66
H is STALE : no accepted report > 35 s
@80
H is CONNECTED : valid report resumes
note bottom of H
 Times are illustrative. State is computed from
 coordinator receipt time, not agent local clock.
end note
@enduml
